{"unit_id":"3afca89feba1e45d1263","title":"九、重申糖尿病用藥規定","kind":"advisory","blocks":[{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b14","raw_text":"九、重申糖尿病用藥規定 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[36.0,457.3260192871094,219.9499969482422,473.2860107421875]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b15","raw_text":"(一)第二線糖尿病用藥:TZD 製劑、DPP-4 inhibitor、SGLT-2 inhibitor\n","start_char":0,"end_char":52,"bbox":[57.263999938964844,487.3260192871094,559.40966796875,503.2860107421875]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b16","raw_text":"此三類藥物限用於已接受 Metformin 使用劑量達 1000 mg/day 三\n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,517.3260498046875,549.7200317382812,533.2860107421875]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b17","raw_text":"個月以上，且 HbA1C 仍大於等於 7 之第二型糖尿病病人。對 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,547.3260498046875,525.5399780273438,563.2860107421875]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b18","raw_text":"Metformin 有使用禁忌或不能耐受者，不在此限。(105.8.26 共識) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":42,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,577.3260498046875,565.5,593.2860107421875]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b19","raw_text":"(二)SGLT2 inhibitor +DPP-4 inhibitor 複方： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,607.3560791015625,406.1200256347656,623.3160400390625]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b20","raw_text":"1.每日限處方1 粒。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,637.3560791015625,224.02999877929688,653.3160400390625]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b21","raw_text":"2.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的 metformin，且併用 SGLT2 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":38,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,667.3560791015625,512.0800170898438,683.3160400390625]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b22","raw_text":"inhibitor 或DPP4 inhibitor 治療至少6 個月，糖化血色素值(HbA1c)\n","start_char":0,"end_char":49,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,697.3560791015625,559.4353637695312,713.3160400390625]},{"page":8,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p8-b23","raw_text":"仍高於7.5%者。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[72.02400207519531,727.3560791015625,196.0699920654297,743.3160400390625]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b1","raw_text":"(三)GLP-1 RA： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":14,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,47.216041564941406,177.58999633789062,63.17604064941406]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b2","raw_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的 metformin 及/或 sulfonylurea \n","start_char":0,"end_char":45,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,77.23600006103516,551.2076416015625,93.19599914550781]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b3","raw_text":"類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6 個月之後，HbA1c 仍高於8.5%\n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,107.23600006103516,553.6199340820312,123.19599914550781]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b4","raw_text":"以上之第二型糖尿病患者:(1)SGLT-2 抑制劑、(2)DPP-4 抑制劑、\n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,137.23599243164062,541.6799926757812,153.1959991455078]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b5","raw_text":"(3)SGLT-2 抑制劑合併DPP-4 抑制劑複方藥品、(4)Insulin \n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,167.23599243164062,505.6200256347656,183.1959991455078]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b6","raw_text":"2.當患者已接受前述口服降血糖藥物，及/或基礎胰島素治療仍未達理\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,197.23599243164062,559.1168212890625,213.1959991455078]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b7","raw_text":"想血糖控制時，與口服降血糖藥物及/或基礎胰島素併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":28,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,227.23599243164062,501.5400085449219,243.1959991455078]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b8","raw_text":"3.發生重大心血管事件，如心肌梗塞、接受冠狀動脈或其他動脈血管再\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,257.2660217285156,559.0841064453125,273.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b9","raw_text":"通術(revascularization)、動脈硬化相關之缺血性腦中風等之病\n","start_char":0,"end_char":39,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,287.2660217285156,541.3450927734375,303.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b10","raw_text":"人，於接受過最大耐受劑量的 metformin 後，仍無法理想控制血糖\n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,317.2660217285156,557.4534301757812,333.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b11","raw_text":"之第二型糖尿病患者，可考慮不須使用其他口服降血糖藥品而考慮使\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,347.2660217285156,559.1651000976562,363.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b12","raw_text":"用 liraglutide 或 dulaglutide 或 semaglutide。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":44,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,377.2660217285156,461.55999755859375,393.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b13","raw_text":"4.本藥品不得與 DPP-4 抑制劑、SGLT-2 抑制劑併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,407.2660217285156,455.44000244140625,423.22601318359375]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b14","raw_text":"5.109 年5 月1 日前已依生效前之給付規定使用本類藥物之病人，得繼\n","start_char":0,"end_char":37,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,437.2860107421875,559.1570434570312,453.2460021972656]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b15","raw_text":"續使用原藥物至醫師更新其處方內容。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":19,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,467.2860107421875,365.5299987792969,483.2460021972656]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b16","raw_text":"(四)GLP-1 RA + insulin 之複方製劑(如 Soliqua) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[57.38399887084961,497.2860107421875,421.4800109863281,513.2460327148438]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b17","raw_text":"1.限用於已接受過最大耐受劑量的 metformin 及/或 sulfonylurea \n","start_char":0,"end_char":45,"bbox":[71.30400085449219,527.2860107421875,551.2076416015625,543.2459716796875]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b18","raw_text":"類藥物，且併用下列藥品之一持續6 個月之後，HbA1c 仍高於8.0%\n","start_char":0,"end_char":36,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,557.2860107421875,553.6199340820312,573.2459716796875]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b19","raw_text":"以上之第二型糖尿病成人病人:(1)SGLT-2 抑制劑、(2)DPP-4 抑制\n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,587.2860107421875,541.6800537109375,603.2459716796875]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b20","raw_text":"劑、(3)SGLT-2 抑制劑合併 DPP-4 抑制劑複方藥品、(4)Insulin(每\n","start_char":0,"end_char":45,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,617.3160400390625,557.6400146484375,633.2760009765625]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b21","raw_text":"日劑量少於60 單位) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":13,"bbox":[85.58399963378906,647.3160400390625,237.58999633789062,663.2760009765625]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b22","raw_text":"2.本品不得與DPP-4 抑制劑、SGLT-2 抑制劑併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[43.08000183105469,677.3160400390625,435.52001953125,707.3160400390625]},{"page":9,"block_id":"MEET-fe0cfef9bfcd90ca5e08-p9-b22","raw_text":" \n","start_char":32,"end_char":34,"bbox":[43.08000183105469,677.3160400390625,435.52001953125,707.3160400390625]}],"source_quality":[]}